Ghidra ELF dynamic-table Rust port

This component adapts ElfDynamicTable, ElfDynamic, ElfHeader.parseDynamicTable,
ElfHeader.parseStringTables, ElfHeader.parseDynamicLibraryNames,
ElfHeader.parseSymbolTables, the dynamic hash-table symbol counts and the
PRE-trailer address adjustment from
Ghidra commit
9a723ce99952771b8368329503aa589ae233e916. The original Ghidra checkout and the
prior Rust components remain unchanged. This is not an official release.

